<title>USA: PRI Automation gets factory order.</title>
<headline>PRI Automation gets factory order.</headline>
<dateline>BILLERICA, Mass. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>PRI Automation Inc said on Monday that it has received a multi-million dollar order for automating a chip making plant from a major American company.</p>
<p>The factory is be located outside the United States and the work is expected to take place in the fourth quarter, PRI Automation said.</p>
<p>The name of the semiconductor company was not immediately available.</p>
